{"step_index":507,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T09:21:52Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T17:21:52+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T17:21:53+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":41,\"agent\":\"verifier\",\"text\":\"@env-2 @anim @sfx **V6 SPIDER-VERSE ITERATION-1 ART-DIRECTOR \\u0026 QUANTITATIVE CRITIQUE -\\u003e ITERATION-2 POLISH CYCLE**\\n\\n**Baseline Technicals Verified PASS**:\\n- **100% V5 Isolation**: `57/57` V5 SHA256 hashes identical (`0` diffs; `LATEST/` untouched).\\n- **3D Banked Physics \\u0026 LOS**: Sub-7mm tire-to-`V6_TrackDeck` lock across `+13.5°` climb, `+17.4°` banked bowl, and `-13.9°` corkscrew (`0` camera obstructions across all 24 shots; `24fps` world/cams + `12fps` On-Twos secondary; `2.63 s/frame` warm CPU).\\n\\n### Ruthless Art-Director Findings \\u0026 Required Iteration-2 Upgrades (`@env-2` -\\u003e `@anim` -\\u003e `@sfx` -\\u003e `@verifier`)\\n\\n#### 1. Hero-Car Pop \\u0026 `CryptomatteV2` Depth Leak (`@anim` — `pipeline/v6_sv_comp.py`)\\n- **Measured Issue**: `PopRatio = CarSharp / BGSharp` drops below `1.0` on **6 shots** (`S01=0.70`, `S02=0.76`, `S08=0.98`, `S19=0.91`, `S20=0.78`, `S24=0.90`) and `Car_CMYK` leaks onto the car (`13.3–24.2` on `S01`, `S05`, `S06`, `S17`, `S20`) for two exact reasons:\\n  1. `vl.pass_cryptomatte_depth = 2` (`v6_sv_comp.py:1321`): whenever translucent `V6_FauxVolumetric_GodRays` blades or glass walls overlap in front of the car (`S01`, `S02`, `S06`, `S20`), the car drops out of the 2-slot Cryptomatte buffer (`car_matte -\\u003e 0`), letting `Kuwahara` \\u0026 `CMYK` smear the hero car! **Fix**: raise `vl.pass_cryptomatte_depth = 6` (`\\u003c0.02s` cost).\\n  2. `Stage 5` (`line 1559`): `bg_ink_fade` applies heavy `Kirsch` Normal ink across nearby skyscraper window grids \\u0026 tunnel ribs, giving background clutter higher edge energy (`BGShp=12–16`) than the car (`CarShp=8–12`). **Fix**: scale background `Normal` Kirsch ink by `* 0.35` on `bg_matte` (keep full crisp `car_ink` on `car_matte`) and push off-focus `Kuwahara` / `CMYK` slightly stronger so `PopRatio \\u003e= 1.30` across hero shots.\\n\\n#### 2. Camera-Space Dual Rim Kick, Tunnel Shadow Block \\u0026 5 Dark Shots (`@env-2` + `@anim`)\\n- **Measured Issue**:\\n  - `S21_hairpin_wheel_macro` (`f=1121`): `MeanL = 34.6`, **`P95 = 85.5 / 255`** (severely underexposed at hairpin apex once `brake_heat` decays!).\\n  - `S07_raidillon_sky_climb` (`MeanL=32.8, P10=0.0`), `S19_tunnel_whip_orbit180` (`MeanL=38.6, CarInk%=36.4%`), `S23_wet_mirror_skyline` (`MeanL=33.6`), `S24_finish_gantry_rise` (`f=1261`: `MeanL=28.7, P10=0.3, CarInk%=38.9%`).\\n  - Meanwhile `S06` (`Clip%=12.3%`), `S17` (`12.7%`), `S22` (`11.3%`) clip \\u003e11% highlights.\\n- **Root Causes \\u0026 Fixes**:\\n  - **`@env-2` (`v6_sv_env.py:412`)**: `NG_SV_ComicSurface` splits Dual Rim Kick using **World `Geometry.Normal.X`** instead of **Camera-Space Normal X**! When driving East/West (`S01/S02`, `S22/S23/S24`), `Normal.X` points nose-to-tail so left/right flanks lose the cyan-vs-magenta split. **Fix**: insert `ShaderNodeVectorTransform` (`WORLD -\\u003e CAMERA`) on `Normal` before `SeparateXYZ.X` so camera-left is ALWAYS electric cyan and camera-right is ALWAYS hot magenta/crimson on all 24 shots!\\n  - **`@env-2`**: Set `V6_StrobeTunnel_Vault.visible_shadow = False` (currently `True`, blocking `LGT_V6Sun`/`LGT_V6SkyFill` so `ShaderToRGB` diffuse irradiance inside `f=908..1041` collapses to `0.0`!), and lift `Mat_RedBull_MatteNavy` base color from near-black `[0.011,0.012,0.014]` to rich comic Prussian-indigo `[0.035, 0.042, 0.105]` so bodywork bands read clearly in night canyons \\u0026 tunnels.\\n  - **`@anim`**: Boost car-linked `LGT_V5Car_0..2` (`135/135/180 W`), lengthen `brake_heat` cooling (`tau_cool ~ 2.6s`) + trigger downshift `V6_FX_ExhaustCone` / `V6_FX_KerbSparks` into `S20`/`S21` so `S21` wheel macro glows molten cherry-orange (`P95 \\u003e= 175`); delay end exposure fade until `f \\u003e= 1270` so `S24` (`f=1261`) reads `MeanL \\u003e= 50`; tone down glare/exposure spikes on `S06`/`S17`/`S22` (`Clip% \\u003c 8.5%`).\\n\\n#### 3. 1080p Ben-Day Halftones \\u0026 Bipolar 45° Pen Crosshatching (`@env-2` + `@anim`)\\n- **Measured Issue**:\\n  - In `v6_sv_comp.py:1282 \\u0026 1517`, `SV_Halftone7px` has narrow `tex = 0.34..0.68` (`±0.17`) via `SOFT_LIGHT` at `ht_f = 0.34` (~`±1.5%` linear contrast — nearly invisible after JPEG!).\\n  - `DiagAnis` averages `1.05–1.15` on 18/24 shots because dark `ink_col` crosshatching on dark navy bodywork has near-zero contrast.\\n- **Fixes**:\\n  - **`@env-2` (`v6_sv_env.py:394–403`)**: Make 45° crosshatching **bipolar** inside `NG_SV_ComicSurface`: dark indigo ink lines in mid-shadow (`0.22 \\u003c irr \\u003c 0.52`) AND crisp luminous indigo-cyan pen hatch strokes in deep shadow (`irr \\u003c= 0.22`) so dark bodywork \\u0026 shadowed towers show unmistakable hand-inked crosshatching!\\n  - **`@anim` (`v6_sv_comp.py:1282`)**: Expand `SV_Halftone7px` to full `0.06 + 0.88 * dots` (`pitch_px = 8.0`) with `ht_f = 0.52..0.64` so 8px Ben-Day dots pop cleanly across midtone sky/buildings/car transitions at 1080p.\\n\\n#### 4. Stronger 3-Act Universe Color Separation \\u0026 Portal Comic-Tear (`@env-2` + `@anim`)\\n- **Measured Issue**: Active mean RGB across acts is currently all blue-led (`Act I [65.8, 60.9, 81.7]`, `Act II [54.2, 66.3, 90.6]`, `Act III [55.1, 48.1, 76.9]`).\\n- **Fixes**:\\n  - **Act I (1610 Miles)**: Push warmer Brooklyn crimson/amber street-glow highlights (`R` lifted) against Prussian-indigo shadows.\\n  - **Act II (65 Gwen)**: Lift pastel **aquamarine/mint-teal + hot-pink/peach** sky \\u0026 `gwen_wash` (`0.62`) so Act II reads unmistakably airy expressionist watercolor vs Act I/III dark night!\\n  - **Act III (928 2099)**: Push aggressive **laser-crimson/vermilion** (`R \\u003e\\u003e G`) neon spikes against deep obsidian-ultraviolet; add sharp diagonal comic-panel border/slash tear overlay on Portal Cuts (`f=426..429`, `f=893..896`).\\n\\n#### 5. Tactile Foreground Foley Boost \\u0026 Doc Sync (`@sfx` + `@anim`)\\n- **`@sfx`**: In `pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py`, boost (+3 dB) the **Eau-Rouge titanium skid-spark crackle (`f=276..308` in Clip 1)** and **Sky-Bridge stay-cable supersonic whoosh (`f=585..620` in Clip 2)** so every showcase clip has a signature tactile foley hook, then re-run `mux_v6_sv.sh --clips` once `@anim` renders the Iteration-2 clips and wake `@verifier`!\\n- **`@anim`**: Align `docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md:74` `sfx_spiderverse_54s.wav` -\\u003e `sfx_spiderverse_53s.wav` after regenerating the 24 stills + `contact_sheet_v6.jpg` + `comic_page_sheet.jpg` + 3× 96f clips (`@env-2` hands off `v6_stage_lookdev.blend` -\\u003e `@anim` -\\u003e `@sfx` -\\u003e `@verifier`).\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 17:19:01\",\"request_id\":\"abfdd25e-752c-43b5-9f9a-1afe09351846\"}],\"head\":41}"}
