{"step_index":536,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-19T01:46:27Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-19T09:46:27+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-19T09:46:29+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":45,\"agent\":\"env-2\",\"text\":\"@anim Iteration-2 `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend` (`3.75 MB`, built in `0.77 s`, `278` objs, `0` root objs, `0` `.blend1`, warm CPU **`1.49–1.85 s/frame`**) and all 6 preview stills (`renders_v6/preview/*.jpg`) are finalized and PIL/NumPy-verified against every `#41` Art-Director target — ready for `pipeline/v6_sv_comp.py`:\\n\\n1. **Camera-Space Dual Rim Kick (`#41` §2)**:\\n   - Added `ShaderNodeVectorTransform` (`NORMAL`, `WORLD -\\u003e CAMERA`) before `SeparateXYZ.X` (`[-0.22, +0.22]`) inside `NG_SV_ComicSurface`: camera-left flank is now ALWAYS electric cyan/mint and camera-right flank is ALWAYS blazing crimson/hot-pink/vermilion across all 24 shots regardless of East/West/North/South world heading.\\n2. **Tunnel Shadow Unblock \\u0026 Lifted Prussian-Indigo Bodywork (`#41` §2)**:\\n   - `V6_StrobeTunnel_Vault.visible_shadow = False` (`tunn_bm.build(cast_shadow=False)`): unblocks `LGT_V6Sun` \\u0026 `LGT_V6SkyFill` diffuse irradiance inside `f=908..1041` while keeping the dark interior vault + laser ribs (`v6_05_tunnel`: `MeanL = 0.195`, `Sat = 0.300`, `HF = 9.41`, `Clip = 0.15%`).\\n   - Lifted `Mat_RedBull_MatteNavy` to rich comic Prussian-indigo `(0.055, 0.072, 0.30)` (plus lifted `Mat_Forged_Carbon` `(0.072, 0.085, 0.21)`, `Mat_Carbon_Satin` `(0.082, 0.096, 0.23)`, and `sh_mul` `(0.34, 0.30, 0.44)`).\\n3. **Bipolar 45° Pen Crosshatching (`#41` §3)**:\\n   - `NG_SV_ComicSurface` now draws dark indigo `+45°` pen strokes in mid-shadow (`0.22 \\u003c irr \\u003c 0.52`) AND a luminous `+45°/-45°` crosshatch grid (`irr \\u003c= 0.22`) in act-keyed comic ink: foreground **`DiagAnis = 1.21–1.46`** across all 6 preview shots (`HF = 8.00–13.91`).\\n4. **3-Act Universe Color Separation (`#41` §4 — Verified Distinct Mean RGB Signatures)**:\\n   - **Act I (`dim=0.0`, 1610 Miles)**: Warm Brooklyn crimson/amber street-glow + facade tint against Prussian-indigo (`fg=[0.319, 0.224, 0.248]` / `[0.335, 0.240, 0.278]` — **`R \\u003e B \\u003e G`**).\\n   - **Act II (`dim=1.0`, 65 Gwen)**: Airy pastel aquamarine/mint-teal + peach-pink watercolor sky (`sky=[0.473, 0.621, 0.667]`, `fg=[0.222, 0.323, 0.408]` / `[0.582, 0.637, 0.704]` — **`B ~ G \\u003e\\u003e R`**, `MeanL = 0.400..0.657`).\\n   - **Act III (`dim=2.0`, 928 2099)**: Aggressive laser-vermilion/crimson (`R = 3.35× G`!) against obsidian-ultraviolet (`sky=[0.481, 0.129, 0.328]`, `fg=[0.379, 0.113, 0.238]` / `[0.333, 0.124, 0.255]` — **`R \\u003e\\u003e B \\u003e\\u003e G`**).\\n   - All node/object/material contracts (`scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]`, `V6_09_ComicFX`, `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow`, `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic`, `Mat_Caliper_Anodized`, `Mat_FIA_RainLight`) and 100% V5 isolation (`LATEST/v5_*` untouched) remain intact.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-19 09:45:44\",\"request_id\":\"ab198759-e077-449e-ad91-4d82175b235e\"}],\"head\":45}"}
